"regions including promoters, enhancers, and other regulatory elements. "
"Returns experiment accessions, biosample details, and accessibility assay"
" metadata. Open chromatin regions are sites of active gene regulation "
"where transcription factors can bind. Use this to find chromatin "
"accessibility data for specific tissues or cell types."
