#: ../../tools/epigenomics_tools.rst:149 5d5a4945416e4c7a99d3802387b2ddf4
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search ENCODE Hi-C and intact Hi-C experiments for 3D "
"genome organization data. Hi-C captures chromatin interactions genome-"
"wide, revealing topologically associating domains (TADs), chromatin "
"loops, and A/B compartments. Returns experiment accessions, biosample "
"details, and metadata. Use this to find 3D genome structure data for "
"specific cell types or tissues. Intact Hi-C is the newer protocol with "
"improved resolution."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/epigenomics_tools.rst:153 9f318c93085943fa9a7ee601147e4fb6
msgid ""
